2. 100% OFFLINE & LOCAL PROCESSING
   All Markdown authoring, GFM HTML compilation (Marked.js), Mermaid diagram
   rendering (Mermaid v11.4.0), bulk Markdown file merging, and PDF/Print export
   operations are performed 100% locally on your computer. Your documents and
   files are never uploaded or transmitted to any external server.

3. AUTOMATIC UPDATE CHECKS (GITHUB RELEASES)
   Markdown Pro includes a built-in Update Service that checks the official
   GitHub repository (https://github.com/KevinK56/MarkdownPro/releases) for new
   versions on startup and when manually requested via Preferences -> Check for
   Updates. You may disable automatic startup update checks at any time from the
   Preferences menu.

